d packet acceptance via /etc/sysctl.d/98-icmp-redirect-hardening.conf (accept_redirects, secure_redirects, accept_source_route set to 0 for all/default/eth0/lo), applied live, then completed the mandatory single-node restart evidence protocol: captured baseline boot_id, issued systemctl reboot, polled until exec was available again, confirmed boot_id changed and uptime reset, and reverified all sysctl values and the config file remained correct post-reboot.\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Captured baseline sysctl values showing accept_redirects=1 (needed hardening) and accept_source_route=0 for all/default\",\"Created /etc/sysctl.d/98-icmp-redirect-hardening.conf setting accept_redirects=0, secure_redirects=0, accept_source_route=0 for all, default, eth0, and lo\",\"Applied config live with sudo sysctl -p and verified all four scopes (all/default/eth0/lo) read 0 for all three keys\",\"Checked for conflicting sysctl definitions in /etc/sysctl.conf, /etc/sysctl.d/, /usr/lib/sysctl.d/ - found only /usr/lib/sysctl.d/50-default.conf setting accept_source_route=0, non-conflicting and lower precedence than the new 98- file\",\"Captured pre-restart boot_id (738d0aac-71a1-4191-8a37-bf00edfeff5d)\",\"Issued sudo systemctl reboot on node1; connection closed confirming acknowledgement\",\"Polled node1 until exec succeeded again (first attempt timed out, second succeeded)\",\"Verified new boot_id (bc9e8061-df32-48a1-ad3b-a47de60a6b68) differs from baseline and uptime reset to ~10s, proving a genuine restart\",\"Re-verified all sysctl hardening values (all/default/eth0/lo) remained 0 post-reboot and confirmed the persisted config file content matches what was written\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"Baseline state before hardening (accept_redirects=1 needing fix)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-c5a5cb746a8941bf\"],\"summary\":\"Showed all/default accept_redirects=1 and accept_source_route=0 before the fix was applied\"},{\"requirement\":\"Persistent config file created for IPv4 redirect/source-route hardening\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-83ce41e1fa4d4a78\",\"cmd-1d5c88918cc6475d\"],\"summary\":\"Wrote /etc/sysctl.d/98-icmp-redirect-hardening.conf and applied it live with sysctl -p, output confirms all keys set to 0\"},{\"requirement\":\"Live sysctl values confirmed disabled for all scopes (all/default/eth0/lo)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-60287faa71d64a30\",\"cmd-bd9f23a5f2244cfb\"],\"summary\":\"Per-interface check showed eth0/lo initially retained accept_redirects=1/accept_source_route=1 until corrected; second check confirms all scopes at 0\"},{\"requirement\":\"No conflicting sysctl source overriding the hardening\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-6fc87d4686714a08\"],\"summary\":\"Only /usr/lib/sysctl.d/50-default.conf also sets accept_source_route=0 (non-conflicting, lower precedence than 98- file)\"},{\"requirement\":\"Pre-restart healthy baseline / boot identity\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-a79e861155b64fc3\"],\"summary\":\"Captured boot_id 738d0aac-71a1-4191-8a37-bf00edfeff5d before reboot\"},{\"requirement\":\"Restart acknowledgement\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-cf7e74d4887447e2\"],\"summary\":\"systemctl reboot issued; connection closed by remote host confirming the command was accepted before disconnect\"},{\"requirement\":\"Node restart recovery / command execution available again\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-64c433661a3a405d\",\"cmd-4207db7c749f4500\"],\"summary\":\"First poll timed out (node rebooting), second poll succeeded confirming exec access restored\"},{\"requirement\":\"Changed boot identity proving genuine restart\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-7eb3017070fc4004\"],\"summary\":\"New boot_id bc9e8061-df32-48a1-ad3b-a47de60a6b68 differs from baseline, and /proc/uptime reset to ~10s\"},{\"requirement\":\"Post-restart persistence of hardening settings and config file\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-7eb3017070fc4004\",\"cmd-dc94712bf0334f3c\"],\"summary\":\"All sysctl values (all/default/eth0/lo) remained 0 for accept_redirects, secure_redirects, accept_source_route after reboot, and the config file content is unchanged on disk\"}]}","structured_output":{"status":"completed","summary":"On node1 (RHEL 7), persistently disabled IPv4 ICMP redirect acceptance and source-routed packet acceptance via /etc/sysctl.d/98-icmp-redirect-hardening.conf (accept_redirects, secure_redirects, accept_source_route set to 0 for all/default/eth0/lo), applied live, then completed the mandatory single-node restart evidence protocol: captured baseline boot_id, issued systemctl reboot, polled until exec was available again, confirmed boot_id changed and uptime reset, and reverified all sysctl values and the config file remained correct post-reboot.","actions_performed":["Captured baseline sysctl values showing accept_redirects=1 (needed hardening) and accept_source_route=0 for all/default","Created /etc/sysctl.d/98-icmp-redirect-hardening.conf setting accept_redirects=0, secure_redirects=0, accept_source_route=0 for all, default, eth0, and lo","Applied config live with sudo sysctl -p and verified all four scopes (all/default/eth0/lo) read 0 for all three keys","Checked for conflicting sysctl definitions in /etc/sysctl.conf, /etc/sysctl.d/, /usr/lib/sysctl.d/ - found only /usr/lib/sysctl.d/50-default.conf setting accept_source_route=0, non-conflicting and lower precedence than the new 98- file","Captured pre-restart boot_id (738d0aac-71a1-4191-8a37-bf00edfeff5d)","Issued sudo systemctl reboot on node1; connection closed confirming acknowledgement","Polled node1 until exec succeeded again (first attempt timed out, second succeeded)","Verified new boot_id (bc9e8061-df32-48a1-ad3b-a47de60a6b68) differs from baseline and uptime reset to ~10s, proving a genuine restart","Re-verified all sysctl hardening values (all/default/eth0/lo) remained 0 post-reboot and confirmed the persisted config file content matches what was written"],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Baseline state before hardening (accept_redirects=1 needing fix)","command_ids":["cmd-c5a5cb746a8941bf"],"summary":"Showed all/default accept_redirects=1 and accept_source_route=0 before the fix was applied"},{"requirement":"Persistent config file created for IPv4 redirect/source-route hardening","command_ids":["cmd-83ce41e1fa4d4a78","cmd-1d5c88918cc6475d"],"summary":"Wrote /etc/sysctl.d/98-icmp-redirect-hardening.conf and applied it live with sysctl -p, output confirms all keys set to 0"},{"requirement":"Live sysctl values confirmed disabled for all scopes (all/default/eth0/lo)","command_ids":["cmd-60287faa71d64a30","cmd-bd9f23a5f2244cfb"],"summary":"Per-interface check showed eth0/lo initially retained accept_redirects=1/accept_source_route=1 until corrected; second check confirms all scopes at 0"},{"requirement":"No conflicting sysctl source overriding the hardening","command_ids":["cmd-6fc87d4686714a08"],"summary":"Only /usr/lib/sysctl.d/50-default.conf also sets accept_source_route=0 (non-conflicting, lower precedence than 98- file)"},{"requirement":"Pre-restart healthy baseline / boot identity","command_ids":["cmd-a79e861155b64fc3"],"summary":"Captured boot_id 738d0aac-71a1-4191-8a37-bf00edfeff5d before reboot"},{"requirement":"Restart acknowledgement","command_ids":["cmd-cf7e74d4887447e2"],"summary":"systemctl reboot issued; connection closed by remote host confirming the command was accepted before disconnect"},{"requirement":"Node restart recovery / command execution available again","command_ids":["cmd-64c433661a3a405d","cmd-4207db7c749f4500"],"summary":"First poll timed out (node rebooting), second poll succeeded confirming exec access restored"},{"requirement":"Changed boot identity proving genuine restart","command_ids":["cmd-7eb3017070fc4004"],"summary":"New boot_id bc9e8061-df32-48a1-ad3b-a47de60a6b68 differs from baseline, and /proc/uptime reset to ~10s"},{"requirement":"Post-restart persistence of hardening settings and config file","command_ids":["cmd-7eb3017070fc4004","cmd-dc94712bf0334f3c"],"summary":"All sysctl values (all/default/eth0/lo) remained 0 for